schema.description:
SSE 流式响应（text/event-stream，UTF-8，每 15s 发送 `:ping` 心跳）。事件类型：
- `meta`：检索完成后、LLM 开始前，data = {task_id, retrieved_chunks[], rewritten_question}
- `delta`：增量文本，data = {content}
- `citation`：引用（可多次），data = {source_type, book_id/note_id, book_title/note_title, page, snippet, chunk_id}
- `done`：生成结束，data = {message_id, version_id, token_usage, latency_ms, refused?}
- `error`：失败，data = {code, message}
- `abort`：用户取消，data = {task_id}
拒答场景：`done` 事件携带 {refused:true, message:"本书中未提及相关内容", threshold, top1_score}。

schema.example:
:ping

event: meta
data: {"task_id":"task_2026xxx","retrieved_chunks":[{"chunk_id":"chunk_1","page":102,"score":0.87}],"rewritten_question":"作者在第 5.2 节如何解释习惯回路这一概念"}

event: delta
data: {"content":"作者在第 5.2 节认为，"}

event: citation
data: {"source_type":"book","book_id":"book_2026a1","book_title":"认知觉醒","page":102,"snippet":"习惯回路包括暗示、惯常行为、奖赏...","chunk_id":"chunk_1"}

event: done
data: {"message_id":"msg_2026xxx","version_id":"ver_2026xxx","token_usage":{"input_tokens":1200,"output_tokens":350},"latency_ms":4200,"refused":false}

